          "status": "lexical_candidate_requires_context"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0084",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "看着眉头皱起的张羽，周天翊好奇道：“我说……你小子以前扎针也不少啊，怎么突然不买了？该不会是没钱了吧？要不要我借点给你？”",
      "source_hash": "55a4daf9132ff2a4e0ac7dd055c4d4c43d2680878b61e8e072cc7728b2816c3f",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0085",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "感受到对方眼中的真诚，张羽却无奈地笑了笑：“不用。”",
      "source_hash": "d94eac3324c7308d6402411dc08a75a832f03ffe4c15052c208d940d5a189a9a",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0086",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "“真不用？”周天翊：“要不你今天先扎我的？”",
      "source_hash": "c150a5f789801d43c99a590c41bf11dfc1fafb43a4ba82f51e35a2d2ee4e3e84",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0087",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "张羽自然连连摇头，他真怕自己再多扎几针就直接暴毙了。",
      "source_hash": "affa9a70ee2e012b29236782fb7d2ff41f0bf8b15ad43a43461bea2bd774628d",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0088",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "根据他脑海中的记忆，这世上可不缺因为药物负荷过大而重创、残疾甚至是死亡的人，甚至嵩阳高中每年都有因为用药过猛而重伤的人。",
      "source_hash": "9c3a092e958f108511e5060a97d1a8b07cbd81d47dfdb60893ecdd67498c4a4e",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0089",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "可就算如此，追求肉体强度而用药的学生仍旧是络绎不绝。",
      "source_hash": "548f2504099b47038b4d74135eb6bc5ca0f943c76db06e20f87e56db1e7eeb06",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0090",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "而原身从上周开始便已经有了不堪重负的迹象。",
      "source_hash": "b624c3e149b59ae3ed613921fbaa3762576e22ba1f00fedc93c571bf5ad85cfa",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
      "source_anchor_candidates": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0091",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "想到原身不但欠下七十万巨债，还给他留下这么一具肉身，张羽心中便再次哀叹。",
      "source_hash": "5ce75daecdd3576d14e6b870962a617c48e8552d0a4d02b1abfa8d5bf91a2fd6",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba",
