  "neighbor_segments": [
    {
      "id": "c0003p0073",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "张羽转身朝着一旁的练习器材走去，打算熟悉一下自己的肉体和体育课程的内容。",
      "source_hash": "1617773aeed8f160f4ebce45f3db8a835969b542c3d5e4db00c47699f266b0ee",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0074",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "周天翊接着说道：“有老师抱怨王海在隔壁办公室挊，射的时候震裂了房顶。”",
      "source_hash": "6cfa556bba444c07f33ecc2b5f1e147a5b8df85ac3955c680e5da0441545a63e",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0075",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "张羽的脚步停了下来，他并不是一个八卦的人，但这么烂的八卦……他得看看到底是怎么回事了。",
      "source_hash": "c33fdaf3f84c1cae9b46289da2a4ff69d5960cd5e09a4fe572fb1fcf249f965c",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0092",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "就在两人窃窃私语的时候，一道冷冽的目光突然扫了过来，只听王海喝道：“上体育课别在下面说小话。”",
      "source_hash": "234b7efb6201341f123b88dfb168237bff09ba4e6d4ecc08fa00c3d243eab8a0",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0093",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "张羽和周天翊立刻停下了交流，各自开始了锻炼。",
      "source_hash": "6fe970a110543f02fd46fb35fcf1af205e7beb9f8a664855ed8568adf90c9e15",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0003p0094",
      "chapter": 3,
      "source": "只见张羽来到一颗大铁球面前，浑身筋肉一震，猛地发力之后，便将一百公斤重的铁球抱了起来。",
      "source_hash": "354c431e2b5063216871c2b1eda095e18c4f328250d616e94816c79f17dcf348",
      "package_hash": "44ea883e369daff4328ef6373fc02ecb47790e1970ef656f3bc50828d5b138ba"
    }
  ],
